      "note": "init 只解析 ext 得到基址与附加参数；分类、列表、详情、搜索的 URL 由基址形态推导。本描述按 App 形态（基址含 api.php/app 或 xgapp）声明端点。"
    },
    {
      "method": "homeContent",
      "file": "_rea/decompiled/ddaf13d7-0206/sources/com/github/catvod/spider/AppYsV2.java",
      "lines": "522-770",
      "note": "列表请求与 JSON 字段映射；列表 URL 三形态仅差路径与参数名，描述按 App 形态接管，Vod 与 Generic 形态的真站基址会走错端点，属已知偏差。"
    },
    {
      "method": "categoryContent",
      "file": "_rea/decompiled/ddaf13d7-0206/sources/com/github/catvod/spider/AppYsV2.java",
      "lines": "419-501",
      "note": "分类路由随基址形态变化：App 请求 nav 带 token，Vod 请求 types，Generic 直接返回固定 6 分类；schema v1 没有按基址形态分支的指令，该入口保留手写实现。"
    },
    {
      "method": "detailContent",
      "file": "_rea/decompiled/ddaf13d7-0206/sources/com/github/catvod/spider/AppYsV2.java",
      "lines": "502-521",
      "note": "详情与线路组结构随基址形态变化：App 读 data.vod_url_with_player，Vod 读 data.vod_play_list，Generic 直接报错没有独立详情接口；无形态分支指令，该入口保留手写实现。"
    },
    {
      "method": "playerContent",
      "file": "_rea/decompiled/ddaf13d7-0206/sources/com/github/catvod/spider/AppYsV2.java",
      "lines": "919-946",
      "note": "按 URL 扩展名判定直链（大小写不敏感），直链 parse 为 0，其余 parse 为 1；手写非直链附带字符串 jx，引擎只能输出数值 jx，属已知偏差。"
    },
    {
      "method": "searchContent",
      "file": "_rea/decompiled/ddaf13d7-0206/sources/com/github/catvod/spider/AppYsV2.java",
